<title>CANADA: Alberta Wheat Pool details harvest progress Oct 18.</title>
<headline>Alberta Wheat Pool details harvest progress Oct 18.</headline>
<dateline>WINNIPEG 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alberta Wheat Pool on Friday detailed the level of harvest progress to Oct 18.</p>
<p>CROP			 PCT COMBINED</p>
<p>Hard Red Spring Wheat	 67</p>
<p>Canada Prairie Spring Wheat 58</p>
<p>Soft White Spring Wheat     97</p>
<p>Winter Wheat		   100</p>
<p>Durum Wheat		     92</p>
<p>Oats				58</p>
<p>Barley			    73</p>
<p>Flax				58</p>
<p>Fall Rye			  91</p>
<p>Canola			    80</p>
<p>-- Gilbert Le Gras 204 947 3548</p>
</text>
